    2 ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E527H

   1 a 0000 E527H: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* [E53/P3] H-A: scalar ENTRY variable, BACKWARD entry     */
   3 a 0006    /* reference.  Discriminates the SELF-ADDRESS law (DEPREC   */
   4 a 0006    /* array cells hold their own address) from the W1 SP-save  */
   5 a 0006    /* variant (DEPREC schedule(0)=error).                      */
   6 c 0006    dcl e entry;
   7 c 0014  et:;
   8 c 0014    e = et;
   9 c 001A    stop;
  10 a 001D end E527H;

